ion":""},"contentType":"story","categoryLabel":"Sports","contentSummaries":{"summary":"We asked readers what they remembered from the 2021 Milwaukee Bucks championship five years ago. Here's what they told us."},"adMeta":{"hashtag":"nba;basketball;sports;historical_moments;milestones;team_profiles;awards_and_honors;interviews;behind_the_scenes;player_profiles","rs":"lmsid:a0a6T00000T1m6EQAR;revsp:milwaukee_journal_sentinel_natl_articles_362;lpstaid:df0948ca-6c47-3867-86bf-c6e954005f29;pct:story","site_attribute":""},"contentTags":{"normalizedTags":{"ymedia":{"provider_id":["milwaukee_journal_sentinel_natl_articles_362"],"signal":["summary_source:provider"],"provider_category":["sports","Local News","nba"],"category":["100000002","non_fin_tier3","100000008"],"hosted":["yes"]},"yfrontpage":{"region":["us"]},"ynews":{"region":["us"]},"ysports":{"region":["us"]}}},"attribution":{"authors":[{"name":"JR Radcliffe, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel","alias":"","title":"","description":"","id":"","logo":null,"social":{"email":null,"facebookId":null,"instagramId":null,"tiktokId":null,"website":null,"twitter":null}}],"provider":{"name":"Milwaukee Journal Sentinel"}},"commentsAllowed":true}}}</script></div></div></div><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push(["https://s.yimg.com/aaq/f10d509c/d2ftq0ol13ke77.js",{}])</script><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push(["https://s.yimg.com/du/benji/benji-2.3.425.js",{}])</script><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src="https://s.yimg.com/xe/next-app-sports/_next/static/chunks/webpack-91bb2e4dac79.js" crossorigin="" id="_R_" async=""></script><div hidden id="S:0"><div class="share-wrapper"><button aria-controls="_R_2cmjplh9av5ubsqlb_" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-label="Share" class="share-btn-top share-closed" data-ylk="elm:share;itc:1;sec:consolidated-share-popup;slk:share-menu-open;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;share&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;consolidated-share-popup&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;share-menu-open&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}"><span><svg class="_ys_1ayoi6i share-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-icon="share-ios" style="--ys-c-icon-default-color:currentColor;--ys-c-icon-light-color:currentColor;--ys-c-icon-dark-color:currentColor" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.54 9.82c.6 0 1.09.49 1.09 1.1V22.9c0 .6-.49 1.09-1.09 1.09H3.09A1.1 1.1 0 0 1 2 22.9V10.92a1.09 1.09 0 1 1 2.18 0v10.9h15.27v-10.9c0-.6.49-1.09 1.09-1.09M11.82 0l4.07 4.63c.4.47.38 1.19-.06 1.62-.45.42-1.13.4-1.54-.07L12.9 4.33v12.04h-2.19V4.33L9.35 6.18c-.41.47-1.1.5-1.55.07a1.2 1.2 0 0 1-.06-1.62z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if("/$"===d||"/&"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else"$"!==d&&"$?"!==d&&"$~"!==d&&"$!"!==d&&"&"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data="$";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};
$RC=function(a,b){if(b=document.getElementById(b))(a=document.getElementById(a))?(a.previousSibling.data="$~",$RB.push(a,b),2===$RB.length&&("number"!==typeof $RT?requestAnimationFrame($RV.bind(null,$RB)):(a=performance.now(),setTimeout($RV.bind(null,$RB),2300>a&&2E3<a?2300-a:$RT+300-a)))):b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RC("B:0","S:0")</script><div hidden id="S:1"><div class="content-body"><p>The five-year anniversary of the <a data-ylk="slk:Milwaukee Bucks;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Milwaukee Bucks&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/sports/bucks/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Milwaukee Bucks</a> winning the 2021 NBA championship has come and gone, and it&#x27;s a little bittersweet in the aftermath of Milwaukee trading franchise cornerstone <a data-ylk="" data-yga="{&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="/nba/players/5185/" rel="">Giannis Antetokounmpo</a> to the <a data-ylk="" data-yga="{&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="/nba/teams/miami/" rel="">Miami Heat</a>. But the memories will endure forever for Milwaukee fans.</p><p>Bucks reporter Jim Owczarski revisited many of those memories with new interviews from the players, coaches and others involved. They included chapters on <a data-ylk="slk:P.J. Tucker;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;P.J. Tucker&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/story/sports/nba/bucks/2026/07/21/what-p-j-tucker-meant-to-milwaukee-bucks-2021-nba-championship-team/90950738007/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">P.J. Tucker</a>, <a data-ylk="slk:Mike Budenholzer;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Mike Budenholzer&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/story/sports/nba/bucks/2026/07/15/how-mike-budenholzer-built-team-unity-milwaukee-bucks-championship-season/90913601007/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Mike Budenholzer</a>, <a data-ylk="slk:Game 6;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Game 6&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/story/sports/nba/bucks/2026/07/20/giannis-trust-in-khris-middleton-led-to-key-shot-in-game-6-of-finals/90950695007/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Game 6</a>, the <a data-ylk="slk:Jrue Holiday steal in Game 5;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Jrue Holiday steal in Game 5&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/story/sports/nba/bucks/2026/07/17/milwaukee-bucks-jrue-holiday-nba-finals-steal-valley-oop-oral-history/90923197007/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Jrue Holiday steal in Game 5</a>, the <a data-ylk="slk:workout that helped Giannis;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;workout that helped Giannis&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yHasCommerce&quot;:false}" href="https://www.jsonline.com/story/sports/nba/bucks/2026/07/14/secret-workout-giannis-antetokounmpo-ready-game-1-nba-finals-knee-injury-bucks/90876892007/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">workout that helped Giannis</a> get back to game play.</p><div class="sda-placeholder-txt">Advertisement</div><div class="bodyad-wrapper hidden" id="sda-body"><div class="sda-text">Advertisement</div><div class="body-ads" id="sda-bodysda"><div class="responsive-sda" id="_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_"><div class="hidden" id="_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlb_"></div><div class="sda-text" style="height:250px;width:300px">Advertisement</div><style type="text/css">#_R_678jplh9av5ubsqlbH1_ { display: none; }
