me in their first-round series against the Miami Heat on Monday, May 24, 2021 at Fiserv Forum.</p></div><span class="caption-credit"> (Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel)</span></div></figcaption></div></figure><figure class="slide-photo" data-inview="false"><div class="snap-start snap-always hidden" data-slide-index="10"><div class="letterboxed-img-wrapper" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><div class="letterbox-bg" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ba7fd2105c08c150cd11689754b9a4e7cd43dd56256a0b77a3c27c40dd24eaaa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5e0d14ba0dc79cce6657909bdffd4e7a&quot;)"></div><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="letterboxed-img" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ba7fd2105c08c150cd11689754b9a4e7cd43dd56256a0b77a3c27c40dd24eaaa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5e0d14ba0dc79cce6657909bdffd4e7a"/></div><figcaption class="caption-node"><div style="max-height:none;overflow:visible"><div class="fig-credit"><p style="margin: 0px;">Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) controls the ball against the Brooklyn Nets during the first quarter of Game 5 of the second round of the 2021 NBA playoffs at Barclays Center on June 15, 2021.</p></div><span class="caption-credit"> (Brad Penner, Brad Penner-USA TODAY Sports)</span></div></figcaption></div></figure><figure class="slide-photo" data-inview="false"><div class="snap-start snap-always hidden" data-slide-index="11"><div class="letterboxed-img-wrapper" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><div class="letterbox-bg" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f0b33407ab895ae87ad6f713247f993c811cfc8d1aa898711ef