margin: 0px;">Milwaukee Bucks Giannis Antetokounmpo holds the Larry O'Brien Trophy as part of the celebration of the Milwaukee Bucks' NBA championship in the downtown Deer District near Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Thursday, July 22, 2021.</p></div><span class="caption-credit"> (Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel)</span></div></figcaption></div></figure><figure class="slide-photo" data-inview="false"><div class="snap-start snap-always hidden" data-slide-index="31"><div class="letterboxed-img-wrapper" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><div class="letterbox-bg" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57e04a478fd5b1c832db388f103b7edcb538bdd316d66ef09210143919c014c5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff7cff0e7b3f87473ba09f8569450dfa2&quot;)"></div><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="letterboxed-img" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57e04a478fd5b1c832db388f103b7edcb538bdd316d66ef09210143919c014c5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff7cff0e7b3f87473ba09f8569450dfa2"/></div><figcaption class="caption-node"><div style="max-height:none;overflow:visible"><div class="fig-credit"><p style="margin: 0px;">Giannis Antetokounmpo scores two of his 26 points  against the Miami Heat during Game 1 of their Eastern Conference first-round playoff series at Fiserv Forum on May 22, 2021.<br><br>The Bucks beat the Heat, 109-107, in overtime on their way to a series sweep.</p></div><span class="caption-credit"> (Quinn Harris, Getty Images)</span></div></figcaption></div></figure><figure class="slide-photo" data-inview="false"><div class="snap-start snap-always hidden" data-slide-index="32"><div c