":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo takes a photo during practice at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Monday, July 19, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe playoffs were held under COVID-19 limitations.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"6d3d63e5-75c7-365f-ad86-7e3142deb71e\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/f77cda68c044b11a07a51e5c5aedbfc2\",\"width\":2900,\"height\":2725},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f0b33407ab895ae87ad6f713247f993c811cfc8d1aa898711efb34f12c0713b4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff77cda68c044b11a07a51e5c5aedbfc2\",\"width\":976,\"height\":917},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b07e98c0705306871f1063a99ea33e596253f2234e8043141f0ce1a0e978a57b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff77cda68c044b11a07a51e5c5aedbfc2\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) attempts a shot as Phoenix Suns center Deandre Ayton (22) defends in the first quarter during Game 5 of the 2021 NBA Finals at Phoenix Suns Arena on July 17, 2021.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo had a team-high 32 points in the Bucks' 123-119 victory. The win put the Bucks ahead in the series, 3-2.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark J. Rebilas, Mark J. Rebilas-USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0e0141d3-e62e-3a2a-af39-1ae60bfa4eee\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/5af88c6f21dd6a3933edb393f619e2f3\",\"width\":5954,\"height\":3969},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f85ebbf23d90f0afbd329f1423de5e84b3c77dd6049800e96247f3ecfcb29648/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5af88c6f21dd6a3933edb393f619e2f3\",\"width\":976,\"height\":651},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/389ff705ee2f136c43d5e5d8e8d6ab22747dbe5a4bbe20b06b827e15685c4296/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5af88c6f21dd6a3933edb393f619e2f3\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) shoots the ball over Atlanta Hawks guard Bogdan Bogdanovic (13) in the first quarter during Game 2 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs on June 25, 2021, at Fiserv Forum. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Michael McLoone, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"6a3d1c19-2d4b-3145-944d-3c5dfadf05dd\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/c614d00af342ddde358abd794218ee2a\",\"width\":3547,\"height\":2360},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/17c40d368970d44adc7249861a5b572122dc09d4dc12460b7c433af271308efe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fc614d00af342ddde358abd794218ee2a\",\"width\":976,\"height\":649},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/24a900fd134c4bacce02787cea3ca181128828be894345721a529a7a73815e87/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fc614d00af342ddde358abd794218ee2a\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo gets iced up during practice at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Monday, July 19, 2021. He played through a hyperextended left knee during the NBA Finals.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"437b7c0f-2d3c-3bd3-aa70-dc9146da2f39\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/2f0643baae4e8cefecc894572f3d6b05\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3806},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0508a57e6c955ff403bd52d6dcc923b582923ec9a5263d0dd18b983a68406941/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F2f0643baae4e8cefecc894572f3d6b05\",\"width\":976,\"height\":952},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d4fcc5a8c4330f8287f8469a2753501526c29ea96aa3d1b7a5feafd9191b3425/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F2f0643baae4e8cefecc894572f3d6b05\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) holds his NBA Finals trophy after the 105-98 win over the Phoenix Suns in Game 6 of the NBA Finals Tuesday, July 20, 2021, at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Ebony Cox / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"8ba2cfc4-ca45-39ae-9dc0-089163f924a9\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/229e37829aad94e910c9c9034ec60225\",\"width\":2663,\"height\":1673},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0d2d7d2643ddf4ae007068d020b29a414dae49d1b914b33213c11e78c3f2c1c2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F229e37829aad94e910c9c9034ec60225\",\"width\":976,\"height\":613},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f5c6e5fe1a3302b29caee2f161a874279307999d105bef239d3a1e042f59c7a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F229e37829aad94e910c9c9034ec60225\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) dunks during the second half of Game 6 of the NBA Finals Tuesday, July 20, 2021, at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo scored 50 points as the Bucks defeated the Suns 105-98 to win the NBA championship.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Ebony Cox / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"d35a0ba7-f35b-3999-bfed-d899e27725ed\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/e03d5bacc2ff69d5bdd9a0c401594ce8\",\"width\":2638,\"height\":3648},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/00706a36a14bcd927ec4b710aa150b167faf2d57f3286715ae3f793fb78e8599/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe03d5bacc2ff69d5bdd9a0c401594ce8\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1350},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d4aed1558862d47b211ba19b17447340a83bdda60faeadb28bfabf7197c557f8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe03d5bacc2ff69d5bdd9a0c401594ce8\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) dunks over Atlanta Hawks guard Lou Williams (6) during the first half during Game 3 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs at State Farm Arena on June 27, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Dale Zanine, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"ce66f5a8-c8a1-38ac-a6e1-66e8bf36cf50\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/4c917355a1a1e91ec32c9ebf68b044f8\",\"width\":2009,\"height\":3013},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/109c9b593743d9c0736593d79245b3bdde38b2406b1075039664ed6ce0d8cacb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F4c917355a1a1e91ec32c9ebf68b044f8\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1464},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a611a13f268ad05f7f38be732f0cbdf5ea279ec74625da8de3c90ab59514a956/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F4c917355a1a1e91ec32c9ebf68b044f8\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) dunks for a basket ahead of Phoenix Suns forward Torrey Craig (12) during the first half in Game 1 of the 2021 NBA Finals at Phoenix Suns Arena. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Matt York, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"fb64f8d8-7ef5-3927-8ae3-7eec7f69c5d7\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/07598cbf002eabc0d65053649b17a390\",\"width\":3858,\"height\":2572},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7bee7d4205a860f144e9da5ec6dc81dd6be712d9cd81d696b9ac88e7279e2cd7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F07598cbf002eabc0d65053649b17a390\",\"width\":976,\"height\":651},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/81309ce13026fb33ecf65e51442ab2c9bc1446c83b31be9d5736aa29269e544b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F07598cbf002eabc0d65053649b17a390\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (right) congratulates forward Khris Middleton (22) after a basket during the third quarter against the Atlanta Hawks in Game 6 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs on July 3, 2021, at State Farm Arena. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo missed the last two games of the series after injuring his left knee in Game 4.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Jason Getz, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"8324a795-b827-3c1a-ba68-e7cb016b04e8\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/609d44c5a0582eb5c489cdf4452df5e8\",\"width\":4386,\"height\":6576},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c17f23c5cdfbb28cab1e1dae8c8f777bc35708bc49525043d8f5cd8f29c318dc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F609d44c5a0582eb5c489cdf4452df5e8\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1463},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/87357faea3c7abc579c6f5cdfd154b9e314ba2423c9666446250b13de0fbc89a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F609d44c5a0582eb5c489cdf4452df5e8\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) drive to the basket past Brooklyn Nets guard Mike James (55) during the 3rd quarter of their eastern conference semifinal playoff game at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Sunday, June 13, 2021. Photo by Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel via USA TODAY NETWORK ORG XMIT: DBY1\",\"credit\":\"Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"4a0ba305-9e01-314e-990b-34350543b3f1\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/e97eb63ac6b07d6c016e0996f7c02575\",\"width\":3100,\"height\":3172},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08ffc173c5f3908f726d1561747887632e3e6d9c888dae9ebec6983b185d40d1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe97eb63ac6b07d6c016e0996f7c02575\",\"width\":976,\"height\":999},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8ae1584cf01209d2852e0791270ebf8ca4e5acc8fe5b151bd8db7c5208cef26f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe97eb63ac6b07d6c016e0996f7c02575\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eInjured Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo congratulates center Brook Lopez (11) during the second half of Game 5 of the Eastern Conference finals game Thursday, July 1, 2021 at Fiserv Forum. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Milwaukee Bucks beat the Atlanta Hawks, 123-112, to take a 3-2 series lead. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo missed the game with a left knee injury. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLopez led the Bucks in scoring with 33 points. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"3b58dc00-51b5-3c10-8d8a-f7999050a200\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/046e9ada69df2f428840edb771757d4a\",\"width\":2024,\"height\":1606},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/28c239e8e9bc872035d11e1f2b46b90b5d232ea149070f7f4bb8ef59b29affab/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F046e9ada69df2f428840edb771757d4a\",\"width\":976,\"height\":774},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/932c6a0d27eb337cac2ee040ea33eb9f3bee26c7f5ccbac5a8bc24431546298b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F046e9ada69df2f428840edb771757d4a\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo celebrates winning the Bill Russell NBA Finals MVP Award after defeating the Phoenix Suns in Game 6 to win the 2021 NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum on July 20, 2021 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Jonathan Daniel, Getty Images\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"c066750e-d87b-3258-90f7-fc6e895886a9\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/726716e4133f90ad314a0906a1a7dcaa\",\"width\":3145,\"height\":2096},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f406b5e0d3534928bef0ae4a578b9e544eac78f684716e63efb47f26f0faf1a6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F726716e4133f90ad314a0906a1a7dcaa\",\"width\":976,\"height\":650},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d1aa16556cbdb8085a311f1e006f5a082bbdfa04d485b8282f0d8da8a725cb58/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F726716e4133f90ad314a0906a1a7dcaa\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) scores two of his game-high 50 points as Phoenix Suns forward Frank Kaminsky (8) tries to block the shot during the fourth quarter of Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe 50 points are tied for most in an NBA Finals clinching game in NBA history.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"18e6c1c7-3831-39ac-ba9a-103d5642f848\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/f9ab2b90a3dd0d574813bc33354d7112\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3967},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/007ddc688b15f8bc4f82dbdff7fcbee45fbdfde1cd84f5e255736ce9d8ee26e1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff9ab2b90a3dd0d574813bc33354d7112\",\"width\":976,\"height\":993},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a28cbffd1190ca28516dd5fa3fd89de035e8f23611ce299d1df3460bb1e47abc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff9ab2b90a3dd0d574813bc33354d7112\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) blocks a shot on Phoenix Suns forward Mikal Bridges during the first quarter of Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt was one of five blocks for Antetokounmpo in the title-clinching game.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"c5e185c0-bdc0-39e9-8de4-6248d48a22fd\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/ef6b5e1e2ea48adfeb590cd77fa80002\",\"width\":2900,\"height\":3435},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bbb592d215f904ed29c9f02c51bd9b4d884728d9534342736fc66c284e4d6391/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fef6b5e1e2ea48adfeb590cd77fa80002\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1156},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a6e3f5a0d5c86b6dd8e0408504ca499dfd67401edf4b0ee23ebdc23cf98eb0c2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fef6b5e1e2ea48adfeb590cd77fa80002\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks assistant coach Darvin Ham hugs Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo as part of the celebration of the Milwaukee Bucks' NBA championship in the downtown Deer District near Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Thursday, July 22, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"76b7d5d5-e8b5-36d1-8971-bf68151ec2c3\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/a1cdb94014b21d2be7f80c2a904d5787\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":2913},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b4f7c2d126b2db984c9b21016cac706f20f5b113169371d857d470af5f54da94/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fa1cdb94014b21d2be7f80c2a904d5787\",\"width\":976,\"height\":729},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/523a3848cdd8c9e4b100c8de8acd2219c076fedda372a394e4aa92afecf7aadb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fa1cdb94014b21d2be7f80c2a904d5787\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates with Milwaukee Bucks forward P.J. Tucker (17) in the closing moments as the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"2a3dbeb4-3858-3c95-9628-2a909db853b2\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/80df5f5433c44258bda9aacf6edd7d07\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3799},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8bc30c5ca57c1b1caa63eac3ca064ec14c4006c3ee4a9dcbb419c2d9b5f3f253/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F80df5f5433c44258bda9aacf6edd7d07\",\"width\":976,\"height\":951},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8696a4123d949846f77b8591d3186a9f7c05f5d68b5c6bfc032fef65d9dc4366/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F80df5f5433c44258bda9aacf6edd7d07\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eWith his knees wrapped with ice bags, Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo watches the end of practice Tuesday, July 13, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee, Wis. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHe managed a left knee injury throughout the NBA Finals but he didn't let it stop him as he averaged 35.2 points per game on 61.8% shooting. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"694780ad-c46c-3012-bc8f-5a418ea19c76\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/51499eb908d7c9da6517708919b8a529\",\"width\":2640,\"height\":4248},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dfbe41e90157bb8278c56417e27be38fd223861087a2f5501551307cf84d0223/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F51499eb908d7c9da6517708919b8a529\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1570},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2d54cfa9db3862ba35d707cf58f3669496714e2f8e16442861b9ed57221df6ff/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F51499eb908d7c9da6517708919b8a529\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22) and Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) talk during the third quarter of Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo scored 50 and Middleton added 17 in the game.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"fd5db509-6e1f-30cd-91e1-c206cd1a648f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/f816f87b3013c8c85f9c05d017f50fa9\",\"width\":2900,\"height\":3711},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c43652250ae013c533a21a4c68ee7d897d36a149453698c8c52aedad77430166/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff816f87b3013c8c85f9c05d017f50fa9\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1249},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d8077aadafd53d690bdc52b4ef38900b0cb12b6a71426c9aabf92968d332e296/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff816f87b3013c8c85f9c05d017f50fa9\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) warms up before Milwaukee Bucks play the Phoenix Suns at the Phoenix Suns Arena in Game 1 of the NBA Finals in Phoenix on Tuesday, July 6, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo returned to action just over a week after hyperextending his left knee in the Eastern Conference finals.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"80871dc2-c306-32f8-b260-c1cb9080dab4\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/458d08bdef6c632f58d56b2a02f07c42\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3384},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d2db1c8f2e4112d94272d09b22f11bd69c3bc37152da4214f6d20b5ff2917ba4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F458d08bdef6c632f58d56b2a02f07c42\",\"width\":976,\"height\":847},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7f3b57703d1423443552e11810063f124ca3e1bdf7e9f02d8e48b2d850818687/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F458d08bdef6c632f58d56b2a02f07c42\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks Giannis Antetokounmpo holds the Larry O'Brien Trophy as part of the celebration of the Milwaukee Bucks' NBA championship in the downtown Deer District near Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Thursday, July 22, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"73cf153f-4c80-3eb7-bc57-803d9980656f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/77f4f3b631b9d364c05e886a0b7ba022\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":4098},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e02d144c162f02a48e6b08bfbeb393ffd653b66e97c4f9d969a07d5ecefcc6fe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F77f4f3b631b9d364c05e886a0b7ba022\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1026},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a795ff0c334742539b79936d712f052c515ed198b4e6e22b8a5a7478dc1a377c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F77f4f3b631b9d364c05e886a0b7ba022\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo scores two of his 26 points  against the Miami Heat during Game 1 of their Eastern Conference first-round playoff series at Fiserv Forum on May 22, 2021.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Bucks beat the Heat, 109-107, in overtime on their way to a series sweep.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Quinn Harris, Getty Images\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"c1e99fd0-12bf-35e0-a4d4-570bad06b3f7\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/f7cff0e7b3f87473ba09f8569450dfa2\",\"width\":3485,\"height\":2324},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/57e04a478fd5b1c832db388f103b7edcb538bdd316d66ef09210143919c014c5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff7cff0e7b3f87473ba09f8569450dfa2\",\"width\":976,\"height\":651},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/72a73b4e2a90ed3792e856ba1f072e349d9e4be752502abb8e7e05427ad8722b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff7cff0e7b3f87473ba09f8569450dfa2\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks' Giannis Antetokounmpo sets up a play against the Atlanta Hawks' Trae Young during the third quarter in Game 1 of the Eastern Conference finals at Fiserv Forum on June 23, 2021 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Patrick McDermott, Getty Images\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"bbdc35c0-a4bd-3826-b345-57fd9b462ee9\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/7efccee068e8d98fb7ce416260e8f8a4\",\"width\":2777,\"height\":2119},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6f62d8aa85201e3317d5a939a257934e73b1a5378ab46f6da1e24fece07302a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F7efccee068e8d98fb7ce416260e8f8a4\",\"width\":976,\"height\":745},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/35aa5bd84e224d88b853188bf237f1a84f6cf91d1c0ab8d06279d595809304c9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F7efccee068e8d98fb7ce416260e8f8a4\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo dunks the ball in the third quarter against Jimmy Butler of the Miami Heat during Game 2 of their Eastern Conference first-round playoff series between the Milwaukee Bucks and the Miami Heat at Fiserv Forum on May 24, 2021.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo had a game-high 31 points on 12 of 23 shooting and 13 rebounds as the Bucks crushed the Heat, 132-98, to take a 2-0 lead in the series.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Quinn Harris, Getty Images\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"1df2374f-c9d7-3986-978e-a7713e132617\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/b67e5a2c17547a95a0a3d9841228c3dc\",\"width\":4972,\"height\":3552},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4a57535cb56cab629ef52a30abe1f2bae94a51f90caf2058a3728b7cd35d64f6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fb67e5a2c17547a95a0a3d9841228c3dc\",\"width\":976,\"height\":697},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/197d9c657327453eb5d21619d8ba3ce8321fb6964a8ca45cc61a39a0e69ff88f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fb67e5a2c17547a95a0a3d9841228c3dc\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) lays the ball up while Phoenix Suns center Deandre Ayton (22) attempts to guard him during the first half of Game 6 of the NBA Finals Tuesday, July 20, 2021, at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo was unstoppable in the title-clinching game, scoring nearly half of the Bucks points in the 105-98 win.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Ebony Cox / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"00aa2111-9b43-34d8-ad01-f79e76fa326e\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/e9ddbedaadf6849b19600cc53b75b32d\",\"width\":2532,\"height\":3252},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c1027436fc290b3f9e00c28eac8d336ed7013e113a435853814a5d996b125696/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe9ddbedaadf6849b19600cc53b75b32d\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1254},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/920908f2732d58057a5f933a1d788f60b88b9f40946f30b9efc328427b183411/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe9ddbedaadf6849b19600cc53b75b32d\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) puts up a shot at the basket in the first quarter of their Eastern Conference semifinal playoff Game 4 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Sunday, June 13, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0110b836-d5b8-386c-8bd5-76f5435fd16a\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/219121b30e982facaa369afb2121e08f\",\"width\":2900,\"height\":3314},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3896f34b08653127df42c991f954c27a251e9bd65b76118548832c5272a578a9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F219121b30e982facaa369afb2121e08f\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1115},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6acb5c85239082d9d865f7938c39221e6d92114b8f46d90aeaa0d3a1c3414b6c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F219121b30e982facaa369afb2121e08f\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) drives to the basket against Brooklyn Nets point guard Mike James (55) and point guard Kyrie Irving (11) during the second quarter of Game 1 in the Eastern Conference semifinals of the 2021 NBA Playoffs at Barclays Center on June 5.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo scored 34 poitns but it wasn't enough as the Bucks fell 115-107 in the series opener.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Brad Penner, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"a998382d-5f0a-3daf-9b63-fcec10974f59\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/c3a24ad48b028953aa2d8917af9adbdd\",\"width\":3458,\"height\":4322},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/44a434f1818c224464c2d5bd23e23fd2be69cea1a430e7e0532089c74fb8b4c6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fc3a24ad48b028953aa2d8917af9adbdd\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1220},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/97fb1cb363f9b1c367e0d6d2066e98c9cd5bfe87c2a53c952d65a18752eac501/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fc3a24ad48b028953aa2d8917af9adbdd\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) dunks during the fourth quarter of their Eastern Conference semifinal playoff game against the Brooklyn Nets at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Sunday, June 13, 2021. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo scored a game-high 34 points in the Bucks' 107-96 win in Game 4 to even the best-of-seven series at 2-2.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0ed8ecb7-a460-37f5-ad2d-36d717c07f27\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/f0da4174cd54d28c6ec09b791efc0b73\",\"width\":2900,\"height\":2867},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/75526c588235ad7261c8942190fd6906f3851fd11dd7a1ac2fc8b5d6b7903cef/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff0da4174cd54d28c6ec09b791efc0b73\",\"width\":976,\"height\":965},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b7a403a57d669a05641ab98c1b859a9d9eae54dcddbfb536ba37c15bbda4a93a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Ff0da4174cd54d28c6ec09b791efc0b73\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates in the closing moments as the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals to win the championship in front of their home fans at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"c91cfcc5-7583-3cec-b7e1-ecb64b3fcdb3\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/6c426cc5c440059dbc4af269809ee489\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3355},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/535a9cb58453550f4137eb0f996571f0890562e157589497bb5f5d0d0abafb28/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F6c426cc5c440059dbc4af269809ee489\",\"width\":976,\"height\":840},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d667952c955d43c1f28844e59f9f83d6901a472b2cbcf97c804e999f26f76708/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F6c426cc5c440059dbc4af269809ee489\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo, right, watches the end of practice Tuesday, July 13, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee, a day before Game 4 of the series.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo managed a left knee injury during the NBA Finals after suffering the injury in the Eastern Conference finals.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"1c450974-28e2-39a1-a0da-f9de249d5f02\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/221e61ae17ea3ef2fdfd1efaf0021ff3\",\"width\":4655,\"height\":3056},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6285e73f506a9024721c8b8adbc8ad9326aa20730b842bc67bb0cf54053c3660/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F221e61ae17ea3ef2fdfd1efaf0021ff3\",\"width\":976,\"height\":641},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7e0b1e602fbef12aad50dbbc7457299e592e5e2a3b0b5f2cd27e834567849a07/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F221e61ae17ea3ef2fdfd1efaf0021ff3\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) dunks the ball as Phoenix Suns forward Jae Crowder (99) looks on during the first half of Game 3 of the NBA Finals game 3 Sunday, July 11, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee. The Bucks won 120-100 to get on the board in the series, the first of four straight wins.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAntetokounmpo scored a game-high 41 points on 14 of 23 shooting, plus 13 of 17 from the free-throw line and 13 rebounds.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"e2112fe3-6843-3752-bd56-037d64d017fc\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/e5dd510d4d17341f4521ba57335e13f7\",\"width\":2168,\"height\":2342},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5089894554315680b26994ada5dadc42130f5a0074ec4ac8d047a77ba260faea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe5dd510d4d17341f4521ba57335e13f7\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1054},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d0c4c8591ab90304a644118be7ed352c5b69ef55fd70c6766ca31288af65cc25/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fe5dd510d4d17341f4521ba57335e13f7\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"14eef33a-a4d2-362e-b7de-a93d092e07ea\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/ae3b279b387b9070b95aa79b0e7f6864\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":5424},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c9684783d339d8e01bc14f4454cd9dd4dea06855c8e9a5a5e8fa7338670d217c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fae3b279b387b9070b95aa79b0e7f6864\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1357},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8becedbaef0ae6a2dcb8b3b49aac8a07ace127812e4adf375d5776d71ea14c8d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fae3b279b387b9070b95aa79b0e7f6864\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHe scored 50 points on 16 of 25 shooting, as well as 17 of 19 on free throws, plus 14 rebounds and five blocks.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"343785b8-89db-3823-b62a-1bdc9f98f22f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/7e83cb8025cd7ee48e073e7a7ad217ab\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":3204},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0989179e67be514cbeaf0f6c403e715eedce1c43d7c3da1b0afb6de69030d44b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F7e83cb8025cd7ee48e073e7a7ad217ab\",\"width\":976,\"height\":802},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4cfaf16f53eeaa1630a79c968f345dad70b64105616b8c32ebdfdc5e96fb4dac/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F7e83cb8025cd7ee48e073e7a7ad217ab\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0254643c-ed43-308b-b218-9914e618747e\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/2eb9923f5ae015bd9510e3ffd5a8de9e\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":2745},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0dcfa69f734c0c2170234d3df8186f315541d736498a7c67bc32f38b09afc599/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F2eb9923f5ae015bd9510e3ffd5a8de9e\",\"width\":976,\"height\":687},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/44e7d5c90e84a8b10c666bbff44f2e86ec2add4903e037c52ad0b65e7edc7ef9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F2eb9923f5ae015bd9510e3ffd5a8de9e\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks assistant coach Vin Baker jokes with Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo during practice at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Monday, July 19, 2021, ahead of Game 6 on July 20.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"f276b3ad-54a6-363f-9329-a19123583ec1\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/a6d4174857eda2b4eceef4934753c007\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":2572},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c6c27b14c1f915168d7f0e520c9e4b848ea4d33909e535b7b22c6c73e01bba62/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fa6d4174857eda2b4eceef4934753c007\",\"width\":976,\"height\":644},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/afd3f349c9f9e140f370c3d23845813b1b1bf908adc560e957ea785262678e99/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fa6d4174857eda2b4eceef4934753c007\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eMilwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) talks with head coach Mike Budenholzer during the first half of their Eastern Conference finals game against the Atlanta Hawks Wednesday, June 23, 2021 at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee, Wis. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Mark Hoffman, Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"db40d9f6-9db4-3b77-9be6-ab3f66a803a1\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/5c153d8def8696bc925b64b194c88700\",\"width\":1676,\"height\":3440},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f597cbfc48ac6697a735b2a5581f8616e6ba9741f9f68cfca317e38ffdb70794/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5c153d8def8696bc925b64b194c88700\",\"width\":976,\"height\":2003},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0ad2b7ae1b27c97e8bd9a8c82a235e41adb71023452aabdb749f08eae67c9d9e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F5c153d8def8696bc925b64b194c88700\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) and Atlanta Hawks center Clint Capela (15) fall to the floor as Antetokounmpo (34) is injured on the play in the third quarter during Game 4 of the Eastern Conference Finals for the 2021 NBA playoffs at State Farm Arena on June 29, 2021. \u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Brett Davis, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"69c2a658-cd1f-312d-851d-5eae594e8a55\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/380d76d809192c27d0de61fe834919bf\",\"width\":3373,\"height\":2249},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e370f12bc687b6a0357b3bdab7ce46036ced8acb5bc1dd194a3004b2bdcb47de/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F380d76d809192c27d0de61fe834919bf\",\"width\":976,\"height\":651},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e45b8308a94122759dee430aefbd27c30f4109424ff356a4791643433a78219e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F380d76d809192c27d0de61fe834919bf\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo (34) puts up a one handed jump shot over Brooklyn Nets forward Blake Griffin (2) in the second quarter during Game 7 in the second round of the 2021 NBA playoffs at Barclays Center on June 19, 2021.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Wendell Cruz, USA TODAY Sports\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"62491953-dc1c-33ba-8519-c0b6537a2087\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/bdaab2ed7abfa01768bd7f94ca73d072\",\"width\":4103,\"height\":2931},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c44cda8942c10ba833abfc0e024211e1a740f4ef26dfe6c89965973fb0d1b2f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fbdaab2ed7abfa01768bd7f94ca73d072\",\"width\":976,\"height\":697},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f5d313164709c53465f7974458581e6dc3ec17bc89f4f1597f3609d054559cfc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fbdaab2ed7abfa01768bd7f94ca73d072\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) has his leg worked on during Game 2 of the NBA Finals against the Phoenix Suns at Phoenix Suns Arena July 8, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0436f5d5-0786-3f44-aa08-12f550a826d6\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/54e27416982f496742a3d4a60c08cd72\",\"width\":3156,\"height\":2726},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/caafb468ef01ce86ee1777dc637e4ecbd004d58380a7d54998ee18ba4ecca3be/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F54e27416982f496742a3d4a60c08cd72\",\"width\":976,\"height\":843},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1e2c9e4f5bfcf7fe2476badb24cdd3ca042955e8f2cbeb9babe92d4a178559fd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F54e27416982f496742a3d4a60c08cd72\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"margin: 0px;\\\"\u003eGiannis Antetokounmpo blocks a shot by Phoenix Suns' Deandre Ayton to preserve the lead late in Game 4 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum on July 14, 2021 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt's one of the most lasting images in NBA Finals history.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"credit\":\"Stacy Revere, Getty Images\",\"headline\":\"Giannis Antetokounmpo highlights during Bucks' 2021 championship run, NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"5571c32e-80e7-3b34-9ecb-9907522f3729\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/cf1a56561f00ab295a3b02337d2268e8\",\"width\":1366,\"height\":2029},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2f75cd08bd14ed98ec46530c53b1c3202e32dba1251b693cba8d9b296f6f052/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fcf1a56561f00ab295a3b02337d2268e8\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1450},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a15653421bf8183e02cd75ad8f283bf8ade4a3f32d2fe42b002c720b61bff7a0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fcf1a56561f00ab295a3b02337d2268e8\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"}],\"alias\":\"https://www.jsonline.com/picture-gallery/sports/nba/bucks/2026/06/11/giannis-antetokounmpo-highlights-bucks-nba-finals-2021-playoffs/83545633007/\"},{\"nodeId\":\"20\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"class\":\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\",\"characterCount\":78,\"level\":2,\"id\":null},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"21\",\"parentNodeId\":\"20\",\"text\":\"What do you remember from the night the Bucks won in Game 6 of the NBA Finals?\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"nodeId\":\"22\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"attrs\":{\"class\":\"wp-block-list\",\"characterCount\":3009},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"23\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"24\",\"parentNodeId\":\"23\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":151},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"25\",\"parentNodeId\":\"24\",\"text\":\"\\\"Being at the game with my son and watching Giannis and the Bucks bring Milwaukee their first championship in 50 years.\\\" – Todd Marohl, Menomonee Falls\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"26\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"27\",\"parentNodeId\":\"26\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":166},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"28\",\"parentNodeId\":\"27\",\"text\":\"\\\"My three kids and grandson being at the game together and the emotions of finally being on top after all the down years!! Special moment!\\\" – Jamie Conom, Sun Prairie\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"29\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"30\",\"parentNodeId\":\"29\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":167},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"31\",\"parentNodeId\":\"30\",\"text\":\"\\\"I was glad that they won and wondered if they could defend their title in a 'normal' season that wasn't affected by COVID-19.\\\" – Michael Izard, Middle River, Maryland\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"32\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"33\",\"parentNodeId\":\"32\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":179},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"34\",\"parentNodeId\":\"33\",\"text\":\"\\\"Feeling like I was in 12 again in 1970-71. Was in the arena for that clincher. Had a sign [that said] Bullets are shot! Made the paper next day.\\\" – Jerry Vales, McHenry, Illinois\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"35\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"36\",\"parentNodeId\":\"35\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":120},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"37\",\"parentNodeId\":\"36\",\"text\":\"\\\"I was at the game with my son, then age 25. It was the sports spectating event of our lives!\\\" – Mike Peters, Oconomowoc\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"38\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"39\",\"parentNodeId\":\"38\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":149},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"40\",\"parentNodeId\":\"39\",\"text\":\"\\\"Being able to attend the game with my son and seeing how charged up and excited the fans were both inside and outside Fiserv.\\\" – Tom Wimmer, Argonne\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"41\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"42\",\"parentNodeId\":\"41\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":191},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"43\",\"parentNodeId\":\"42\",\"text\":\"\\\"I was there with my then 16-year-old son. We flew in from our home in Boulder, Colorado, to see Game 6 in person and oh was it worth the trip. Epic night!\\\" – Jason Gerlach, Boulder, Colorado\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"44\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"45\",\"parentNodeId\":\"44\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":181},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"46\",\"parentNodeId\":\"45\",\"text\":\"\\\"I watched Game 6 in the Deer District, on the old Bradley Center lot. Huge crowd, a pretty close game and then pure pandemonium when the Bucks won it.\\\" – Bill Cole, Menomonee Falls\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"47\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"48\",\"parentNodeId\":\"47\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":117},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"49\",\"parentNodeId\":\"48\",\"text\":\"\\\"The Full Buck Moon a few nights after the big game. Very appropriate timing.\\\" – Pete Schmidt, Nolensville, Tennessee\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"50\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"51\",\"parentNodeId\":\"50\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":154},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"52\",\"parentNodeId\":\"51\",\"text\":\"\\\"I was at Fiserv Plaza with thousands of fans. The atmosphere was electric and the group went crazy at the final buzzer. It was amazing!\\\" - Mac, Milwaukee\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"53\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"54\",\"parentNodeId\":\"53\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":166},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"55\",\"parentNodeId\":\"54\",\"text\":\"\\\"Welcomed our first child May 2021. Watched all of the playoffs with sleepless infant. House asleep night of championship, celebrated silently.\\\" – Nathaniel, Appleton\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"56\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"57\",\"parentNodeId\":\"56\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":148},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"58\",\"parentNodeId\":\"57\",\"text\":\"\\\"I remember being in the Deer District and standing in disbelief as the first sky cam shot showed the crowd downtown. Chills!\\\" – Nick Koss, Franklin\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"59\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"60\",\"parentNodeId\":\"59\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":150},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"61\",\"parentNodeId\":\"60\",\"text\":\"\\\"For my wife and I, game 1 vs. Miami at the Deer District was our first big outing post COVID. A sunny, daytime game with others!\\\" – Jason, West Allis\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"62\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"63\",\"parentNodeId\":\"62\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":61},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"64\",\"parentNodeId\":\"63\",\"text\":\"\\\"Giannis' big game in the deciding game.\\\" – Kurt, River Falls\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"65\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"66\",\"parentNodeId\":\"65\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":189},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"67\",\"parentNodeId\":\"66\",\"text\":\"\\\"I was driving back to Arizona from Wisconsin and watching game 6 in Texas at a packed bar but only two tables watching the game. Ours and Suns fans! Fun!\\\" – John Francois, Phoenix, Arizona\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"68\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"69\",\"parentNodeId\":\"68\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":125},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"70\",\"parentNodeId\":\"69\",\"text\":\"\\\"Being in the building for the last timeout when everyone knew the Bucks had the game won. Unreal.\\\" – Pat, Columbia, Missouri\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"71\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"72\",\"parentNodeId\":\"71\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":248},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"73\",\"parentNodeId\":\"72\",\"text\":\"\\\"Was overnight in Reno, Nevada, on a trip to Vegas with kids. Told them Bucks stories and finished with 'Bucks in 6.' Had to bet on Bucks in 6 of course. WINNER. Wouldn't cash the ticket unless I could keep it.\\\" – Mark Ellis, Lebanon, New Hampshire\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"74\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"75\",\"parentNodeId\":\"74\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":174},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"76_e0\",\"parentNodeId\":\"75\",\"text\":\"\\\"Being there to witness Game 6 in person with my son, who was 20 years old at the time, and experiencing the championship events is a lasting memory.\\\" – Garry, \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"nodeId\":\"76_e1\",\"parentNodeId\":\"75\",\"text\":\"Houston\",\"type\":\"text\",\"attrs\":{\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://sports.yahoo.com/nba/teams/houston/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"\",\"class\":\"link\",\"data-ylk\":\"{\\\"slk\\\":\\\"Houston\\\",\\\"elm\\\":\\\"context_link\\\",\\\"itc\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"sec\\\":\\\"content-canvas\\\"}\"}}]}},{\"nodeId\":\"76_e2\",\"parentNodeId\":\"75\",\"text\":\", Texas\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"77\",\"parentNodeId\":\"22\",\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"78\",\"parentNodeId\":\"77\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"attrs\":{\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"characterCount\":173},\"content\":[{\"nodeId\":\"79\",\"parentNodeId\":\"78\",\"text\":\"\\\"Being there with my son - greatest night of our lives. Then heading to the Ambassador where we joined my wife and were up until 2 in the morning!\\\" – Paul Krueger, Sheboygan\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"nodeId\":\"80\",\"parentNodeId\":null,\"type\":\"slideshow\",\"uuid\":\"0c2e51e0-ee83-30c0-a011-60ab43457388\",\"attrs\":{\"contentItemId\":\"0c2e51e0-ee83-30c0-a011-60ab43457388\"},\"photos\":[{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22) and Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) holding the Larry O'Brien NBA Championship Trophyafter the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"0d5fc15b-ddb0-3039-be52-3c05cb587d6f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/bc59e6e47475e4e3661ff9c0cd8d872a\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":6033},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/86fe1b04ee5bf60a9e54012a137a9def31c541c2fdb3c7c47e8638ca86412051/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fbc59e6e47475e4e3661ff9c0cd8d872a\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1510},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e225bdf513490ace006a7f9ba5cf1d2378f4761e2ded3603a2726c97ef6d91f1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fbc59e6e47475e4e3661ff9c0cd8d872a\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) holds his NBA FINALS MVP Trophy as Milwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22) holds the Larry O'Brien NBA Championship Trophy after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"d43e09e4-4bec-3331-8510-0d72b3aba91f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/8c656d91ca6d8d8957e2447567e41b14\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":5650},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bb906d1519875d138ff1789471aba072d533a574d21d75b3c151c4203f5769d2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F8c656d91ca6d8d8957e2447567e41b14\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1414},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c00ec5fb691a1421599829d65fe8035ab329b3e0001694066d95d56921b2b279/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F8c656d91ca6d8d8957e2447567e41b14\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22), left, holds the Larry O'Brien trophy and Giannis Antetokounmpo has the Finals MVP trophy after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals on Tuesday, July 20, 2021, at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"8b0ba11f-904d-3096-a2c5-087166202a5f\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/96cdac6c3d57d7123b535e262477f6d1\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":6040},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dc5fe34596c8acea6406c12de3e3e3a74a38a859a53100688bda54c596ce8313/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F96cdac6c3d57d7123b535e262477f6d1\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1512},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/738382e94ff26049d2428d0539320be9be934a28597ea9cba033896e372493fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F96cdac6c3d57d7123b535e262477f6d1\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22) and Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) hug while holding the Larry O'Brien NBA Championship Trophyafter the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"679d6205-ed9d-36dc-ae2b-5a1d572605b9\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/1751cced4d52b757a85bd7f215e65194\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":5499},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/991fd5e7604941763478deeba4fe322dc535c4d36e5ce4192ac317ba71f2ca0d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F1751cced4d52b757a85bd7f215e65194\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1376},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/47fcbb3b70abe6dc22a977e44b024f47a7b31d35e80a1edc59827116d3b7b621/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2F1751cced4d52b757a85bd7f215e65194\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Khris Middleton (22) and Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) hug while holding the Larry O'Brien NBA Championship Trophyafter the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"eea0903a-3f23-3826-9ec0-129c849187dd\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/ed9e48cedc6f585b513a8dd30fa1fcc3\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":5408},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ebca6e5b1a45f68b94e5ac55c19c34bd633f1c1b82e91dda491eb7ff5b54d125/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w976%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fed9e48cedc6f585b513a8dd30fa1fcc3\",\"width\":976,\"height\":1353},\"thumbnail\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f70928bce1231ee54af32dd11023d4e806e95fd53f3199213e0bfbbaaed4c253/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w160_h100%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fmilwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156%2Fed9e48cedc6f585b513a8dd30fa1fcc3\",\"width\":160,\"height\":100}},\"type\":\"image\"},{\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"Milwaukee Bucks forward Giannis Antetokounmpo (34) celebrates after the Bucks won Game 6 of the NBA Finals at Fiserv Forum in Milwaukee on Tuesday, July 20, 2021.\",\"credit\":\"Mike De Sisti / Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\",\"headline\":\"Milwaukee Bucks win NBA title! See photos from Game 6 of NBA Finals\",\"id\":\"96f1a2ea-f47f-31e0-937b-491c5388222b\",\"size\":{\"original\":{\"url\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/milwaukee_journal_sentinel_national_slideshows_156/17dfe815de04fe5328f1ae5047bce20c\",\"width\":3900,\"height\":5424},\"resized\":{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/02da04da42ee